{"title": "BOOOAL's Blessing (Condition)", "pageid": 48339, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/BOOOAL's_Blessing_(Condition)", "categories": ["Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">For the equivalent bonus that can be acquired permanently, see <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/BOOOAL%27s_Benediction_(Condition)\" title=\"BOOOAL's Benediction (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/56/BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/56/BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"BOOOAL's Benediction\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/56/BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/BOOOAL%27s_Benediction_(Condition)\" title=\"BOOOAL's Benediction (Condition)\">BOOOAL's Benediction</a>.</div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/56/BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/56/BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"BOOOAL's Blessing Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/56/BOOOAL%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>BOOOAL's Blessing</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>The wielder has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> against <a href=\"/wiki/Bleeding_(Condition)\" title=\"Bleeding (Condition)\">Bleeding</a> creatures, as long as there are <a href=\"/wiki/Kuo-toa\" title=\"Kuo-toa\">Kuo-toa</a> to worship <a href=\"/wiki/BOOOAL\" title=\"BOOOAL\">BOOOAL</a>. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>UID: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UND_BOOOALGIFT</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UND_BOOOALGIFT+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UND_BOOOALGIFT+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>When first acquired, the <a href=\"/wiki/Sickle_of_BOOOAL\" title=\"Sickle of BOOOAL\">Sickle of BOOOAL</a> will have this condition attached, but it will disappear after long resting with the weapon in your inventory. This can be avoided by dropping or stashing it in a container prior to each long rest.</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\"Sources_of_BOOOAL.27s_Blessing\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_BOOOAL's_Blessing\">Sources of BOOOAL's Blessing</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sickle_of_BOOOAL\" title=\"Sickle of BOOOAL\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Sickle_of_BOOOAL_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Sickle_of_BOOOAL_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Sickle_of_BOOOAL_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Sickle_of_BOOOAL_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Sickle_of_BOOOAL_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Sickle_of_BOOOAL_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Sickle_of_BOOOAL_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Sickle_of_BOOOAL_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Sickle_of_BOOOAL_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Sickle_of_BOOOAL\" title=\"Sickle of BOOOAL\">Sickle of BOOOAL</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201526\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.057 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.061 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1672/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 20605/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7550/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 28/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.022/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1052652/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   54.555      1 -total\n 73.62%   40.165      1 Template:Condition_page\n 45.60%   24.877      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 26.31%   14.352      1 Template:Hatnote